## Architecture

### Save/load (JSON snapshots)
Procedural world regenerates from `world_seed`; saves store **deltas + runtime state**:

| Section | Contents |
|---------|----------|
| `terrain_edits` | Height deltas, build tiles |
| `channels` | Water level, flow direction |
| `features` | Tile overrides + feature metadata (plants, growth, channels) |
| `crystal` | Depth field, spawns, power, evolution, absorption progress |
| `player` | Position, health, stats, inventory, relics |
| `game` | Phase, run state |
| `town_defense` | Per-town state + health |
| `entities` / `crystal_enemies` | Mob/enemy snapshots |
| `config` | GameConfig subset (via ConfigJsonIO) |

**Load order:** bootstrap world → apply overlays → rebuild chunks → restore crystal/player/entities.

**Files:** `systems/save_game_service.gd`, `systems/save_codec.gd`, `config/save_game_config.gd`

### Topographical map
Downsampled biome/height map with crystal, water, channel, town, ruin overlays.

- **Minimap** (top-left, always on): 160×160, ±128 cells around player
- **Fullscreen** (**U**): 512×512 regional view

**Files:** `systems/topographical_map_builder.gd`, `config/topographical_map_config.gd`, `ui/topographical_map.gd`

