### Likely segfault source addressed

Worker threads were calling `get_surface_height_uncached` / `get_tile_type_uncached`, which read **mutable static dictionaries** (`TerrainEdits`, `FeatureRegistry`) while the main thread could write during digging/building. That race can cause signal 11. Chunk gen now snapshots overrides on the main thread and uses worker-only APIs.

