├── WorldVisuals (Node3D)       ← NEW: all world-space sprites
│   ├── Entities (Node3D)       ← animals, crystal enemies
│   └── FeatureVisualLayer      ← vegetation / ruins / walls
├── WorldFeatures (logic only)
