Fixed the visual rendering pipeline. Root cause: visuals refreshed **before** `ChunkManager` existed, so billboards/meshes never populated even though textures loaded into the registry.

## Root Causes

1. **Boot-order race** — `GameVisualRegistry.refresh_all()` and `FeatureVisualLayer.repopulate_all()` ran while `chunk_manager == null`, so feature billboards/buildings silently no-op'd.
2. **Missing late-bind hook** — `FeatureVisualLayer` never connected to `chunk_ready` if `ChunkManager` was created after its `_bind()` ran.
3. **Entity coordinate mismatch** — entities used raw column indices as world X/Z (`4.5`) instead of scaled coords (`9.0` at `voxel_scale=2`), placing sprites off-terrain.
4. **Spawn markers hidden** — `_sync_spawn_marker_visibility()` hid markers outside loaded sim chunks (distant spawns invisible at origin).

## Fixes Applied

| Area | Change |
|------|--------|
| `feature_visual_layer.gd` | Added `on_chunk_manager_ready()`, `_await_chunk_manager()`, `_bind_chunk_streaming()` |
| `world_visuals.gd` | Awaits `ChunkManager` before `repopulate_all()` |
| `world_features.gd` | Calls feature layer + `refresh_world_visuals()` when CM is ready |
| `performance_service.gd` | New `refresh_world_visuals()` — registry, features, spawn markers, combat VFX |
| `world_entity.gd` + `entity_navigation.gd` | Entity positions use `column_to_world` scaling |
| `crystal_manager.gd` | Active spawn markers always visible |
| `game_visual_registry.gd` | Improved Sprite3D material (render priority, alpha scissor) |
| `verify_visual_pipeline.gd` | New integration test for HIGH preset population |

