## Assistant

Added a lightweight in-game developer chat wired to a new `DeveloperAssistant` service.

### How to use
- **T** — open/close the chat bar at the bottom of the screen
- **Enter** — send your message
- **Esc** — close chat
- **Shift+T** — `channel_water` (moved off T so chat can use it)

### What was added

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `systems/developer_assistant.gd` | Chat backend: slash commands + AI file bridge |
| `ui/dev_chat_overlay.gd` | Bottom `LineEdit` + short history label |
| `scripts/dev_assistant_respond.gd` | Headless helper to write AI replies |
| `scripts/dev_assistant_respond.sh` | Shell wrapper for external tools |
| `scripts/verify_dev_chat.gd` | Automated regression (in `run_all_verify.sh`) |

### Assistant behavior
- **Slash commands** (instant, in overlay + Output): `/help`, `/status`, `/preset low|medium|high`, `/tp <x> <z>`
- **Free text** — logged to `user://dev_assistant/requests.jsonl`, printed as `[DevAssistant] >> ...` in Godot Output, and polled for replies in `responses.jsonl`

### Replying from outside the game (Cursor / AI)
```bash
